  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Development: Smallholder Agriculture Transformation and Agribusiness Revitalization Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to increase agricultural productivity and commercialization on the part of smallholder farmers for the vegetable, rice and oil palm value chains in selected counties of Liberia. The geographic area will indicatively consist of the following counties: Bomi, Gbarpolu, Grand Gedeh, Grand Cape Mount, Lofa, Nimba, Margibi, Maryland and Sinoe.</narrative>
  </description>
